test("SDK failure with no identity cannot use rollout rate limiting",async()=>{class FakeCodex{constructor(_options:unknown){}startThread(_options:unknown){return{runStreamed:async()=>({events:(async function*(){yield goodEvents[1];throw new Error("terminal")})()})};}}await assert.rejects(()=>runCompatibilityProbe(new SdkCodexExecutor(FakeCodex as any),"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutFilesIsolation({"rollout.jsonl":rolloutContent("object-thread")}).isolation),/COMPATIBILITY_PROBE_FAILED/);});
const ENVELOPE_0="Exit code: 0\nWall time: 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n# Codex Project Execution Contract\r\n\r\nBody";
const ENVELOPE_1="Exit code: 1\nWall time: 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\nboom";
const FINAL_TEXT="# Codex Project Execution Contract\n\nThe first Markdown heading is \"**Codex Project Execution Contract**\".";
function successRollout(threadId:string,o:{provider?:string;cwd?:string;sessionModel?:string|false;turnModel?:string|false;calls?:{callId:string;command?:string;output?:string;outputCallId?:string}[];preTool?:string;postTool?:{agent?:string;message?:string}[];taskComplete?:{error?:unknown;lastAgentMessage?:string}|false;extraSession?:boolean;extraTaskComplete?:boolean}={}){const provider=o.provider??"openrouter";const cwd=o.cwd??"w";const session:any={type:"session_meta",payload:{id:threadId,session_id:threadId,model_provider:provider,cwd}};if(o.sessionModel!==false&&o.sessionModel!==undefined)session.payload.model=o.sessionModel;const records:any[]=[session];if(o.extraSession)records.push({type:"session_meta",payload:{id:threadId+"-b",session_id:threadId+"-b",model_provider:provider,cwd}});if(o.turnModel!==false)records.push({type:"turn_context",payload:{turn_id:"turn-1",model:o.turnModel??"v/m:free"}});if(o.preTool!==undefined){records.push({type:"event_msg",payload:{type:"agent_message",message:o.preTool}});records.push({type:"response_item",payload:{type:"message",role:"assistant",content:[{type:"output_text",text:o.preTool}]}});}for(const call of o.calls??[{callId:"call-1",output:ENVELOPE_0}]){records.push({type:"response_item",payload:{type:"function_call",name:"shell_command",arguments:JSON.stringify({command:call.command??"Get-Content AGENTS.md"}),call_id:call.callId}});if(call.output!==undefined)records.push({type:"response_item",payload:{type:"function_call_output",call_id:call.outputCallId??call.callId,output:call.output}});}for(const p of o.postTool??[{agent:FINAL_TEXT,message:FINAL_TEXT}]){if(p.agent!==undefined)records.push({type:"event_msg",payload:{type:"agent_message",message:p.agent}});if(p.message!==undefined)records.push({type:"response_item",payload:{type:"message",role:"assistant",content:[{type:"output_text",text:p.message}]}});}if(o.taskComplete!==false){const tc:any={type:"event_msg",payload:{type:"task_complete"}};const t=o.taskComplete??{lastAgentMessage:FINAL_TEXT};if(t.lastAgentMessage!==undefined)tc.payload.last_agent_message=t.lastAgentMessage;if(t.error!==undefined)tc.payload.error=t.error;records.push(tc);}if(o.extraTaskComplete)records.push({type:"event_msg",payload:{type:"task_complete",last_agent_message:FINAL_TEXT}});return records.map(r=>JSON.stringify(r)).join("\n");}
function falseNegativeExecutor(threadId="current-thread"){let calls=0;const executor:any={execute:async()=>{calls++;return{threadId,events:[{type:"thread.started",thread_id:threadId}],finalResponse:""}}};executor.calls=()=>calls;return executor;}
function itemErrorEvents(threadId="current-thread"){return[{type:"thread.started",thread_id:threadId},{type:"item.completed",item:{type:"error",id:"e1",message:"recoverable item failure"}}];}
function itemErrorExecutor(threadId="current-thread"){let calls=0;const executor:any={execute:async()=>{calls++;return{threadId,events:itemErrorEvents(threadId),finalResponse:""}}};executor.calls=()=>calls;return executor;}
function recovery(content:string|undefined,threadId="current-thread"){return runCompatibilityProbe(falseNegativeExecutor(threadId),"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(content));}
test("rollout success recovery proves exact successful rollout for SDK false-negative",async()=>{const executor=falseNegativeExecutor();const report=await runCompatibilityProbe(executor,"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(successRollout("current-thread")));assert.equal(report.worktree_unchanged,true);assert.equal(report.final_completion_success,true);assert.equal(report.tool_loop_success,true);assert.equal(executor.calls(),1);});
test("normal SDK SUCCESS prefers SDK evidence and never reads rollout",async()=>{let calls=0;const executor:any={execute:async()=>{calls++;return{finalResponse:"# heading",events:goodEvents}}};const report=await runCompatibilityProbe(executor,"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(successRollout("current-thread")));assert.equal(report.worktree_unchanged,true);assert.equal(calls,1);});
test("rollout recovery never overrides thrown executor failure or structured 429",async()=>{await assert.rejects(()=>runCompatibilityProbe({execute:async()=>{throw new Error("terminal")}} as any,"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(successRollout("current-thread"))),/COMPATIBILITY_PROBE_FAILED/);const rateLimited={type:"turn.failed",error:{codex_error_info:{response_too_many_failed_attempts:{http_status_code:429}},message:"429 Too Many Requests"}};await assert.rejects(()=>runCompatibilityProbe({execute:async()=>({threadId:"current-thread",events:[rateLimited],finalResponse:""})} as any,"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(successRollout("current-thread"))),error=>{assert.equal((error as Error).message,COMPATIBILITY_PROBE_RATE_LIMITED);return true;});await assert.rejects(()=>runCompatibilityProbe({execute:async()=>{throw new CodexExecutionError(429)}} as any,"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(successRollout("current-thread"))),error=>{assert.equal((error as Error).message,COMPATIBILITY_PROBE_RATE_LIMITED);return true;});});
test("rollout recovery fails when current thread is missing",async()=>{await assert.rejects(()=>runCompatibilityProbe({execute:async()=>({events:[{type:"thread.started",thread_id:"x"}],finalResponse:""})} as any,"v/m:free","w",{},"clean",()=>"clean",now,rolloutIsolation(successRollout("current-thread"))),/COMPATIBILITY_PROBE_FAILED/);});
test("rollout recovery rejects wrong thread, provider, cwd, and model correlation",async()=>{for(const content of [successRollout("other-thread"),successRollout("stale-thread"),successRollout("newer-thread"),successRollout("current-thread",{provider:"wrong-provider"}),successRollout("current-thread",{cwd:"other-worktree"}),successRollout("current-thread",{turnModel:"other:free"})])await assert.rejects(()=>recovery(content),/COMPATIBILITY_PROBE_FAILED/);});
